message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated manuscript and archived release."
title: "Analysis-unit dependence and effect-aware calibration in human kidney thick ascending limb single-cell studies"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhi
    given-names: Peng
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-2201-5131"
  - family-names: Yan
